submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "raw_logs": [
      "/workspace/output/log.hold"
    ]
  }
}
```

Provide native thermo tables with Step (using the prescribed 1 fs timestep) or Time (elapsed fs), Temp (K), and Density (g/cm3). The evaluator uses samples from 390,000 to 470,000 fs to calculate the final hold means. List additional log files only if needed to supply those samples.
